s in digital hardware for efficient computation.\n2. \"Evolutionary Echo State Network: evolving reservoirs in the Fourier space\" - Uses evolutionary algorithms to optimize the reservoir's structure in the Fourier domain for anomaly detection.\n\nBoth papers contribute to the application of ESNs in specific contexts, with one focusing on hardware implementation and the other on evolutionary optimization.","role":"assistant"},"model":"qwen2.5:7b","prompt_eval_count":773,"prompt_eval_duration":45414000,"total_duration":2594931500}}